{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44794","headline":"病愈寄友 · 法振","name":"病愈寄友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"哀乐暗成疾，卧中芳月移。\n西山有清士，孤啸不可追。\n捣药昼林静，汲泉阴涧迟。\n微踪与麋鹿，远谢求羊知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}